    "title": "Trunk-or-Treat event set for October 29 with games and costume contest - Cobb Reporter",
    "text": "On October 29, 2025, a Trunk-or-Treat event is scheduled to take place. The event will feature decorated vehicles, games, food trucks, face painting, and a costume contest. Admission for children is $3 and must be paid in cash.\nThe organizers aim to create an enjoyable environment with various activities for attendees. The event encourages participation in themed costumes and promises opportunities for families to make memories together.\n“Join us for a night of spooky decorations, thrilling games, and delicious treats for unforgettable memories filled with laughter and scares!” states the announcement. “See you there…if you dare!”",
